{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/23/2855869/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーもっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海苔が大好き松坂くんですー＾＾＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て、こらーっ(๑òωó๑)ｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、先日の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木どこ」見てくださった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございますー(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己アピール、本当はちゃんとやったんだよー(´,,･ω･,,`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャッチフレーズも「覚えてくだーさゆにゃん☆」って、出川さんと一緒にやったし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルネームなら、「井戸の上に咲く小さい百合→井上小百合」で、覚えやすいです♪って、話したり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本編では意味わかんなくなっちゃってたけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、いっちばん最初に出川さんが答えようとして、指名してくれたのも私だったんです。だから印象には残ってたのかなー...(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに、あのあと実は罰ゲームがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ頑張ったのにカットされちゃったーｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てほしかったなー(´･ω･｀)私の勇姿～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長した姿見せれると思ったのになー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ仕方ないっ...(* ^^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また頑張りますっ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日はNOGIBINGO!の収録でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ったので、今度こそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カットされないことを祈る(｡> <｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、海苔は大好きじゃあないよっ！ｗｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、本日は福岡♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルは玲香と一緒～っ(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外と仲良いの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/23/2855869/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかっ！れいーかっ！れーいか！れかれかれか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップラーメンに1時間かけて食べてたからめっちゃビックリされました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ早い方なのになぁ(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、福岡のみなさんよろしくお願いしますっ（ミ＾o＾ミ）☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛り上がっていきましょーーーー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/23/2855869/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}